# shadcn/ui Component Usage

## shadcn/ui Guidelines
- Always use shadcn/ui components when available
- Import from `@/components/ui/` directory
- Use proper component variants and sizes
- Follow shadcn/ui patterns for customization

## Common Components
- **Button**: Use `asChild` prop with Next.js Link
- **Dialog**: Use `DialogContent` with `DialogTitle` for accessibility
- **Icons**: Use Lucide React icons consistently

## Button Usage
```tsx
<Button asChild size="lg" className="bg-orange-400 hover:bg-orange-400/90">
  <Link href="/contact">Get Involved</Link>
</Button>

<Button variant="outline" size="sm" className="border-pink-500 text-pink-500 hover:bg-pink-500 hover:text-white">
  <Link href="/facebook">Follow us</Link>
</Button>
```

## Dialog Usage
```tsx
<Dialog open={isOpen} onOpenChange={setIsOpen}>
  <DialogContent className="max-w-6xl w-full h-[95vh] p-0">
    <DialogTitle className="sr-only">
      Image Gallery for {siteName}
    </DialogTitle>
    {/* Content */}
  </DialogContent>
</Dialog>
```

## Component Import Pattern
```tsx
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { Dialog, DialogContent, DialogTitle } from '@/components/ui/dialog'
```